# "If you don't draw a card this way": Bot1 controls a creature with a counter (Sage of the Fang), but the Envoy's draw is replaced by dredging Golgari Grave-Troll back (CR 702.52a),
# so no card is drawn and the Envoy gets its +1/+1 counter. (Bot1 entombed the Troll on turn 1 and declined to dredge the turn 3 draw step.)

